Implemented owned slice: generic executor, run controls, offline tests, integration docs. No core/main/settings/store/manifest changes or commits.

**Executor export**
```ts
executeWorkflow(options: {
  run: WorkflowRun;
  registry: BlockRegistry;
  context: (blockId: string) => BlockContext;
  outputs?: Record<string, Record<string, PipelineData>>;
  onUpdate: (run: WorkflowRun) => void | Promise<void>;
}): Promise<{
  run: WorkflowRun;
  outputs: Record<string, Record<string, PipelineData>>;
}>;
```

Supports DAG routing, merge/fan-out, builtin fallback, nested boundaries, output validation, independent branch preservation, cancellation, and nested HIL pause/resume. Preserves research provenance. No human decisions.

UI auto-saves root graph using default scope, streams status/logs/counts, cancels runs, inspects outputs, distinguishes agent collection outcomes, and exports JSON/XLSX/CSV through IPC.

